    "chunk_text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat Trincomalee on the 30th day of July 2025 at 11.00 o'clock. And you are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 07 th day of July 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensatin and the details of the computation of such amount. All deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry. N.MATHIVANNAN, Divisional Secretary, Town & Gravets Trincomalee. Divisional Secretariat, Trincomalee, 16th June, 2025. EOG 06 - 0248\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
