    "description": "Land Aquisition - Kavudawa, Monaragala D/S Division, Monaragala District, Land Aquisition - Correction Paper Kurunegala  D/S Division, kurunegala District, Land Aquisition - Correction Paper Kurunegala  D/S Division, kurunegala District,",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/extra-gazettes/egz_2025.html",
