    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2442/31 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 24 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.24\n\nNo. 2442/31 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 24, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy No.: MO/DS/LAN/06/01/41. Land Ministry No. : 4-3/4/2015/D/66.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land / servitude which is required for the 121 infantry headquarters of the Sri Lanka Army, Kumbukkana.\n\nParticulars of the land to be acquired.\n\nThe plots of land depicted in sheet No. 1 in Volume No. 3 in the Cadastral Map No. 720106 dated 20.03.2025 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys of Monaragala, situated in the Village Called Kavudawa (a part), No. 131A Kumbukkana Grama Niladhari Division of Monaragala Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Monaragala District, Uva Province.\n\nSchedule 01. Lot No. : 01 Name of land: Parawila Watta; Ownership requested by Land Reform Commission; Extent: 4.7844 Hectares.\n\n02. Lot No. : 04 Name of land: Parawila Watta; Ownership requested by Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.3220 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. : 06 Name of land: Parawila Watta; Ownership requested by Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0687 Hectare."
